@startuml screenflow-auth
' Spec 001 — screen flow. Each state is a screen (key elements listed); each arrow is a user action.
' Every user story US-001-1..9 is a path through this diagram (see table in spec.md).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #f8fafc
  BackgroundColor<<email>> #fffbeb
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #f1f5f9
  BorderColor #94a3b8
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11

title Spec 001 — screen flow (375 px)

state "Public pages" as Public <<public>> {
  state "Home / Browse jobs" as Home
  Home : ☰  jairojobs  [Log in]
  Home : region choices: All regions · Cebu · …
  Home : search field  [Search] · type: Any type ▾
  Home : "3 jobs · newest first"
  Home : rows: title · business, area, region ·
  Home : salary · date · ✓ Approved (spec 005)
  Home : "Every listing shows salary and is checked…"
  state "Listing detail" as Detail
  Detail : ← Jobs in <region>
  Detail : title, business
  Detail : ✓ Approved · Posted 2 h ago · region
  Detail : facts box, sections
  Detail : "Applying through jairojobs is coming soon."
  Detail : (spec 005; no Apply button until spec 007)
  Home --> Detail : tap a listing
  Detail --> Home : ← Jobs in <region>
}

state "Drawer (☰)" as Drawer
Drawer : Visitor: Browse · Sign up · Log in
Drawer : Candidate: Browse · My applications · My profile · Settings · Log out
Drawer : Employer: Browse · My listings · Post a job · Settings · Log out
Drawer : Admin: Browse · Admin · Settings · Log out

state "Sign up" as Signup
Signup : "Register for an account"
Signup : "Already registered? Log in to your account now."
Signup : Email ______________
Signup : (•) Looking for work
Signup : ( ) Hiring
Signup : [ Create an account ]

state "Email: the link" as Email <<email>>
Email : From: jairojobs <hello@jairojobs.com>
Email : Subject: "Confirmation instructions" (first time)
Email : or "Log in instructions" (later)
Email : plain text with one link
Email : "This link expires in 15 minutes\nand can only be used once."

state "Link landing" as Landing
Landing : "Welcome <email>"
Landing : first time: [ Confirm and stay logged in ]
Landing : [ Confirm and log in only this time ]
Landing : later: [ Keep me logged in on this device ]
Landing : [ Log me in only this time ]
Landing : (nothing is confirmed and nobody is logged in\nuntil a button is pressed)

state "Log in" as Login
Login : "Don't have an account? Sign up for an account now."
Login : Email ______________
Login : [ Log in with email → ]
Login : — or —
Login : Email ______  Password ______
Login : [ Log in and stay logged in → ]
Login : [ Log in only this time ]
Login : message after sign-up: "An email was sent to <email>,\nplease access it to confirm your account."
Login : message after asking for a link: "If your email is in\nour system, you will receive instructions\nfor logging in shortly."

state "Settings" as Settings
Settings : Account type: Candidate\n"Account type can't be changed here."
Settings : Email ______________  [ Change email ]
Settings : New password ______  Confirm new password ______
Settings : [ Save password ]
Settings : (opens within 10 min of log-in;\nsubmit within 20 min, else log in again)

state "Email: confirm new address" as EmailChange <<email>>
EmailChange : Subject: "Update email instructions"
EmailChange : plain text with one link
EmailChange : (the link expires in 7 days)

state "Operator terminal" as Terminal <<terminal>>
Terminal : mix jairojobs.admin promote EMAIL
Terminal : mix jairojobs.admin demote EMAIL
Terminal : (prod: bin/jairojobs eval …)

[*] --> Home : open site\n(no account needed)
Home --> Drawer : ☰
Drawer --> Home : Browse jobs
Drawer --> Signup : Sign up
Drawer --> Login : Log in
Home --> Login : [Log in]
' The Apply button, and its way to Log in for someone logged out, arrive with spec 007.
' Until then the listing page offers nothing that needs an account (spec 005, REQ-005-5).
Signup --> Login : submit\n(message: an email was sent)
Signup --> Login : "Log in" link
Login --> Login : ask for a link\n(message: if your email is in our system…)
Login --> Home : password OK\n(logged in)
Login --> Login : wrong password\n(generic error)
Login --> Email : open inbox
Email --> Landing : tap link
Landing --> Home : press a button\n(confirmed the first time,\nlogged in)
Email --> Login : link invalid or expired →\n"Magic link is invalid or it has expired."
Drawer --> Settings : Settings\n(logged in)
Settings --> EmailChange : change email →\nlink sent to NEW address
EmailChange --> Settings : tap link →\nemail updated
Settings --> Settings : set / change password
Drawer --> Home : Log out\n(session cleared)
Terminal --> Settings : role changes;\nuser sees new role\non next request
Terminal -[hidden]-> Drawer

legend right
  |= Shade |= Meaning |
  | light grey | public, no account |
  | amber | email, outside the app |
  | slate | operator only, not a screen |
endlegend

@enduml
